# The hod jib scenarios, in the order to run them (LHM-76, LHM-77).
# Copy these lines into BepInEx\scenarios\playlist.txt, in place of the vaettir-jib-* lines already
# there. This file is not a .txt on purpose: Devkit lists every .txt in a scenario folder as a
# scenario, and a playlist is not one.
#
# Cheapest and least invasive first. skin only reads, so it runs before anything is built. The two
# that wait on a bench or a shed come last because they take the longest.
vaettir-jib-skin
vaettir-jib-collider
vaettir-jib-ring
vaettir-jib-hammer
vaettir-jib-limits
vaettir-jib-networks
vaettir-jib-chain
